<title>UK: UBS sets 250 million stg 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>UBS sets 250 million stg 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   UBS LONDON</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN STG   COUPON     8.0	 MATURITY    08.JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.62     PAY DATE    08.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  35 BP     REOFFER    99.62     SPREAD	+39 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	*AA1	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  *AA+	DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC  20 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.50 PCT GILT DUE 2006</p>
<p> NOTES	*ON CREDITWATCH</p>
<p>		 UNION BANK OF SWITZERLAND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
